{
  "_comment": [
    "VideoObject - for /services/hard-drive-destruction and /services/data-destruction.",
    "",
    "Puts a video thumbnail in the search result and makes the page eligible for the",
    "Video tab. For a service where buyers want proof of process (shredding",
    "demonstration, facility tour, chain-of-custody walkthrough), this is a strong",
    "click-through lever.",
    "",
    "Required: name, description, thumbnailUrl, uploadDate.",
    "",
    "The video must be visibly embedded on the page and playable - do not mark up a",
    "video that is not actually present. contentUrl (direct file) and/or embedUrl",
    "(player) should be provided so Google can fetch it.",
    "",
    "duration uses ISO 8601: PT2M30S is 2 minutes 30 seconds.",
    "",
    "hasPart with Clip objects produces the key-moments treatment in results. Only",
    "include it if the timestamps are real."
  ],

  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "VideoObject",
  "name": "REPLACE_WITH_VIDEO_TITLE (e.g. Inside Our Cincinnati Facility: NIST 800-88 Hard Drive Destruction)",
  "description": "REPLACE_WITH_DESCRIPTION of what the video shows.",
  "thumbnailUrl": [
    "https://core-asset-sol.com/REPLACE_WITH_THUMBNAIL_16x9.jpg"
  ],
  "uploadDate": "REPLACE_WITH_ISO_DATETIME_WITH_OFFSET",
  "duration": "REPLACE_WITH_ISO_8601_DURATION",
  "contentUrl": "https://core-asset-sol.com/REPLACE_WITH_VIDEO_FILE.mp4",
  "embedUrl": "REPLACE_WITH_PLAYER_URL_IF_HOSTED_EXTERNALLY",
  "publisher": {
    "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/#organization"
  },
  "transcript": "REPLACE_WITH_FULL_TRANSCRIPT - improves eligibility and is independently useful for accessibility and AI retrieval.",
  "hasPart": [
    {
      "@type": "Clip",
      "name": "REPLACE_WITH_CHAPTER_NAME",
